  "description": "[Incubating] Build-time guardrails for F# code using Axial: flags ambient effects (clock, randomness, GUIDs, console, filesystem, process, environment), exceptions in flows, shared test fixtures, raw concurrency and other effect-boundary mistakes. Fast syntax advice runs on every build and never fails it on guidance; Full mode and `axial check --full` (Axial.Tool) run the complete typed checks against a checked-in, reviewed policy.",
